  <para style="h">2 Kọrint</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Kọrint</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kọrint</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kọ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Kọrint</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Mme ndima ufan, ñwed emi oto Pọl emi Abasi ekemekde ete edi isuñutom Jisọs Kraist, ye eyen ete ñnyin Timoti, ñnyin iwet ñwed emi inọ esọk kpukpru ufọk Abasi emi edude ke Kọrint; ye kpukpru ikọt Abasi emi edude ke Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Yak mfọn ye emem oto Abasi Ete ñnyin ye Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist esim mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasi Ke Akanyanyaña Ñnyin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Itoro enyene Abasi ye Ete Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist, Ete mbọm ye Abasi kpukpru idọñesit. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Emi ọdọñde ñnyin esit ke kpukpru ukut ñnyin, man otodo ñnyin ikeme ndidọñ mme mmọ emi edude ke ukut ekededi esit, oto ke idọñesit emi ñnyin ibọde ito Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kpa nte ndutuhọ Kraist ọyọhọde ọduọhọ ke uwem ñnyin, kpa ntre ke idọñesit ñnyin onyuñ awak oto ke Kraist. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Edi edieke ñnyin ikutde ukut, edi man mbufo enyene idọñesit ye edinyaña; edieke ñnyin ibọde idọñesit, edi man mbufo enyene idọñesit emi anamde mbufo enyene ime ye ukeme ndiyọ ukem ukem ndutuhọ emi ñnyin inyuñ iyọde. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ñnyin imonyuñ inyene ọkpọsọñ idorenyin ibaña mbufo, koro ñnyin imọfiọk ite, kpa nte mbufo ebuanade ke ndutuhọ ñnyin, ntre ñko ke mbufo etiene ebuana ke idọñesit ñnyin.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ñnyin ikpamaha mbufo etre ndifiọk, nditọ ete, mbaña nsọñọ ñkpọ ye ufen emi ñnyin ikekutde ke Esia. Mbiomo emi ekedoride ñnyin ke ibuot ama okpon onyuñ odobi ke usuñ emi akanamde ñnyin iduọk idorenyin ibaña uwem. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Ñnyin ikekere ite ke ana ọnọ ñnyin ndikpa. Edi emi eketibe man ñnyin ikudori enyin ke ukeme idem ñnyin, edi idorenyin ke Abasi ikpọñ emi emenerede akpa ñkpa esin ke uwem. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Enye ama afak ñnyin osio ke utọ enyene ndik usuñ ñkpa oro, ndien Enye eyesuk anyaña ñnyin. Ñnyin imemen idorenyin ñnyin idori ke Enye ite ke Enye eyeka iso ndinyaña ñnyin, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />nte mbufo ekade iso ndiñwam ñnyin ke akam mbufo. Ntre ke edibọrọ mme uwak akam emi ebọñde enọ ñnyin, ndien Abasi eyediọñ ñnyin; ndien ediwak owo eyemenede uyo mmọ enọ Abasi ekọm kabaña ñnyin.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Emi edi mbure emi ñnyin iburede: Esit ñnyin etie ntiense abaña nte ñnyin ikakamade idem ñnyin ke ererimbot, akpan akpan ke ebuana ñnyin ye mbufo ke edisana usuñ ye ke esit akpanikọ emi okotode Abasi. Ñnyin imenam emi ito ke mfọn Abasi; ikedighe ke ifiọk owo. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Kpukpru se ñnyin iwetde inọ mbufo, edi se mbufo ekemede ndikot añwaña mbufo. Ami mmenim nte eyetim añwana mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Edi okposuk edi emi mbufo ediọñọde ñnyin ubak ubak idaha emi, ami mmenim ke akpanikọ nte ke mbufo eyediọñọ ñnyin ọyọhọ ọyọhọ, man otodo mbufo ekpebure mbure ebaña ñnyin ke usen Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs kpa nte ñnyin ñko idiburede mbure ibaña mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ami mma ntim mfiọk mme ñkpọ emi, oro akanam ami mbiere ndibemiso ndise mbufo, man otodo mbufo ekpebọ edidiọñ ikaba. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ami mebiere ndikut mbufo ke usuñ isañ mi ndika Masidonia, ye ke ini emi ami ndifiakde edem do, man otodo ami ñnyene uñwam nto mbufo ke isañ mi ndika Judia.<verse eid="2CO 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntaha Abiatde Ini-e?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Mme edikere mi ntem edi mfefere mfefere? Mme ami nnam uduak mi ke ido ererimbot man otodo ami ñkpọdọhọ “Ih” ye “Ih Ih” inikiet? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nte Abasi edide anam akpanikọ, ikọ emi ñnyin itiñde inọ mbufo idighe “Ih” ye “Ih Ih”.<verse eid="2CO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Koro Jisọs Kraist, Eyen Abasi, emi ami ye Silfanọs ye Timoti ikọkwọrọde ke otu mbufo, idighe “Ih” ye “Ih Ih.” Ke editim ntiñ, Enye edi “Ih” Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Mme eñwọñọ Abasi ewak nte ewewak, ke Kraist kpukpru mmọ edi, “Ih”. Emi edi ntak emi ñnyin idọhọde ite “Amen” isin ke ubọñ Abasi oto ke Jisọs Kraist. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Ndien Enye emi anamde ñnyin ye mbufo isọñọ ida ke Kraist, onyuñ eyetde ñnyin aran enim edi Abasi, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Emi okonyuñ enimde ñnyin idiọñọ ke idem nte mme inyene Esie onyuñ esinde Spirit Esie ke esit ñnyin, nte ubọñ ọnọ kpukpru mme ñkpọ emi Enye etimde enim ọnọ ñnyin.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Ami mmada Abasi nte ntiense mi, koro ñketre ndidi ke Kọrint, man ami ndifina mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Idighe nte ñnyin iñwana ndikara mbuọtidem mbufo, edi iñwana ndiñwam mbufo ndinyene idaraesit, koro edi ke mbuọtidem ke mbufo esọñọ eda.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ke ntre ami mma mbiere nnọ idem mi, nte ke nditọñọke ntak aba nnam mbufo efuhọ ke ini ndidide ndise mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Koro edieke nnamde mbufo efuhọ, anie ndien edinam mi ñkop inemesit? Edi mbufo enyene ndinam, ndien mbufo ekeme didie edieke ami nnamde mbufo se ibiakde mbufo? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Oro edi ntak emi ñkewetde ñwed oro nnọ mbufo. Ami ñkoyomke ndidi mbine mbufo ndibọ idiọkesit ke ubọk mme mmọ emi ekpenamde mi ñkop inemesit. Koro ami mọyuhọ nte ke ini ami ñkopde inemesit, kpukpru mbufo nde emekop inemesit.<verse eid="2CO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Koro ñketie ke akwa ukut ye mfuhọ ke esit ye ediwak mmọñeyet; ñwet ñwed oro nnọ esọk mbufo man efiọk ima emi ami mmade kpukpru mbufo nte okponde.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Edi owo ekededi emi anamde mfuhọ odu, enye itimke inam mi mfuhọ, nte enye akam anamde kpukpru mbufo efuhọ. Ami ñyomke ndida enye ndodobi ndodobi. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Ufen emi ediwak mbufo enọde utọ owo emi ekem ye enye. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Idahaemi edi ini ndidahado nnọ enye, ñnyuñ ndọñ enye esit. Midighe ntre enye ekeme ndikabade mfuhọ ata eti eti, ndien ọnọ enye idiọkesit ke usuñ emi enye midikemeke ndifiak ndu uwem emi ọfọnde aba. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Mbọk ewut enye idahaemi ete ke mbufo ke esuk emama enye eti eti.<verse eid="2CO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anie Ekem Ke Utom Emi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ntak emi ami ñkewetde ñwed oro edi man ami ñyarade mfiọk nte mbufo esọñọde eda ke idomo, ndien mme eyenyuñ esuk ibuot enọ mme item mi. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ke ini mbufo edaharedo enọ owo kiet ekededi, ami medahado nnọ enye ñko. Ndien se ami mma ñkefen nnọ — edieke ñkpọ odude ami ndifen nnọ — ami ñkefen ke iso Kraist ke ntak mbufo, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />man otodo Setan edikan ñnyin ubọk; koro ñnyin imọdiọñọ se mme uduak esie edide.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Ke ini ami mma ñkasaña ñkesim obio Troas ndikwọrọ eti mbuk emi abañade Kraist, ami mma ñkut nte ke Abasi ama eberede usuñ ọnọ utom Esie do. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Ami ñkenyeneke ifure ke esit mi, sia mmeñkekwe Taitọs eyen ete ñnyin; anam mma ñkọm mmọ unyọñ, ndien ndaha ñka Masidonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Edi yak ekọm enyene Abasi, emi adade ñnyin asaña ubọñ ubọñ ke Kraist kpukpru ini, onyuñ adade ñnyin anam ifiọk Esie asuana ke kpukpru ebiet nte ufuọñ enem ufik ñkpọ. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Koro ñnyin itie nte enem utebe ufuọñ ñkpọ, emi Kraist awade ọnọ Abasi emi asuanade ke otu mme mmọ emi enyañade ye mme mmọ emi etakde. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ke otu mme mmọ emi etakde, enye edi ata idiọk utebe emi owotde wot; edi ke otu mme mmọ emi ema ekenyaña edi enem ufuọñ ñkpọ emi ọnọde uwem. Anie ndien ekeme ndinam utọ utom oro? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Ñnyin itiehe nte mme mmọ eken, emi ekwọrọde ikọ Abasi ke ntak udori, edi ñnyin itiñ ikọ Kraist ke iso Abasi, nte mme anam akpanikọ, ye nte mmọ emi Abasi ọdọñde.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mbuọtidem Mbufo Ọsọñọ Utom Ñnyin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Nte ñnyin imọñ itọñọ ntak itoro idem ñnyin? Mme ana nte ñnyin, nte mme mmọ efen, ibọ ñwed itoro ida isọk mbufo, mme ñnyin ndibọ mbufo ñwed itoro nda nsọk mme mmọ efen? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Mbufo ke idem mbufo, edi ñwed emi ñnyin iwetde ke esit mbufo inọ kpukpru owo ndidiọñọ ñnyuñ ñkot. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Mmọ ekeme ndikut ete ke mbufo edi ñwed emi otode Kraist, emi ñnyin iwetde. Idighe ñwed emi edade eto ye mmọñ ñwed ewet, edi, eda Spirit odu uwem Abasi ewet, ndien idighe enye emi ekapde ke itiat, edi ewet ke esit mme owo.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Ñnyin inyene oruk mbuọtidem emi ke Abasi ito Kraist. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Ñkpọ ndomokiet iduhọ ñnyin ke idem emi akpanamde ñnyin ibiere ite ke ñnyin imenyene ukeme ndinam utom emi. Ukeme emi ñnyin inyenede oto Abasi, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />edi Enye anam ñnyin inyene ukeme nte mme anam utom obufa ediomi, emi midighe mme ibet emi ewetde wet, edi, edi ediomi emi ebọpde ke Spirit. Ibet emi ewetde wet ada ñkpa edi, edi Spirit ọnọ uwem.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obufa Ubọñ Kraist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Edieke utom emi akadade ñkpa edi, emi ekekapde ke itiat ekedide ye uteñe tutu anam nditọ Isrel ikekemeke ndiwuk enyin nse Moses ke iso oto ke ntak uteñe esie, okposuk edi nte uyama oro ke iso Moses ekenimede, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />nte utom Spirit ikpenyeneke uku ye uteñe ikan oro? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Edieke utom emi akadade ubiomikpe ọsọk owo akasañade ye uteñe, adaña didie ke utom emi adade edinen ido edi ekpenyene uteñe akan! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ke ntak uteñe emi ayamade akan idahaemi, uteñe emi akayamade ke mme ini emi ekebede osop. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Edieke se idibede ifep ekenyenede ubọñ, adaña didie ke se ididude ke nsinsi edinyene ubọñ ikan!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Mmọdo sia ñnyin inyenede utọ idorenyin emi, ñnyin imenyene uko. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Ñnyin inyuñ idighe Moses, emi akadade ufukñkpọ ofuk iso esie, man nditọ Isrel edikut nte Uteñe oro akatahade onyuñ osop.<verse eid="2CO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Edi ema enam esit mmọ ọsọñ, ndien tutu esim mfin emi efuk esit mmọ ye ukem ufukñkpọ nte mmọ ekekot mme ñwed akani Ediomi. Efuhọde ufukñkpọ oro efep ke ini emi owo adianade ye Kraist ikpọñ ikpọñ. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Anam tutu esim mfin emi adaña nte mmọ ekotde ñwed mbet Moses, ufukiso oro osuk ofuk esit mmọ.<verse eid="2CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Edi ekeme ndifuhọde ufukñkpọ oro, kpa nte ñwed Abasi etiñde abaña Moses ete, “Ema efuhọde ufukñkpọ esie ke ini emi enye ọkọwọñọrede ese Ọbọñ.” <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Ọbọñ edi Spirit oro, ndien ebiet emi Spirit Ọbọñ odude, uwọrọufin odu do ñko. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Edi kpukpru ñnyin emi iso ñnyin mifuhọke ufukñkpọ, imosio ubọñ Ọbọñ iwut; ndien kpa ubọñ oro emi otode Abasi emi edide Spirit, akabade ñnyin esin ke mbiet Esie ke ñkoññkan ubọñ.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Abasi ke mfọnido Esie ọmọnọ ñnyin utibe utom emi ndinam, anam esit iduọhọ ñnyin. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Edi ñnyin ima iduọk mme ndibe ndibe ido emi enyenede but; ñnyin isañake ke ñkari, inyuñ idaha nsu ibuak ye ikọ Abasi. Edi ke ediyarade se idide akpanikọ añwa añwa, ke ñnyin inam kpukpru owo efiọk ke esit mmọ ete ke ñnyin imanam se inende ke iso Abasi.<verse eid="2CO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Koro edieke efukde Eti Mbuk emi ñnyin ikwọrọde, efuk ebaha mme mmọ emi etakde. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Mmọ inimke ke akpanikọ koro ifiọk abasi eyo emi amanam esit mmọ ekim. Enye ọbiọñọ mmọ ndikut uñwana emi ayamade ọnọ mmọ; uñwana emi otode ke Eti Mbuk emi abañade ubọñ Kraist, emi edide nnen nnen mbiet Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Koro ñnyin ikwọrọke ibaña idem ñnyin, edi ikwọrọ ke Jisọs Kraist edi Ọbọñ; ndien ñnyin idi ifin mbufo ke ntak Jisọs. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Koro edide Abasi emi ọkọdọhọde ete, “Yak uñwana ayama ke ekim”, akanam uñwana Esie ayama ke esit ñnyin, ndinọ ñnyin uñwana ifiọk ubọñ Abasi emi odude ke iso Kraist.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Udọñ Ñkpọ emi Ebiarade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Edi ñnyin inyene ñkpọuto emi ke esio mbat, ndiwut nte ke akwa odudu emi oto Abasi, itoho ñnyin.<verse eid="2CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Efik ñnyin ke kpukpru nde, edi ñkpọ ibiakke ñnyin; etimede ñnyin, edi inamke ñnyin inana idorenyin; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />ekọbọ ñnyin edi Abasi ikpọñke ñnyin; enuk ñnyin eduọk ke isọñ, edi ikemeke ndisobo ñnyin. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ñnyin ke ibiom ñkpa Jisọs kpukpru ini ke ikpọkidem ñnyin isaña, man uwem Jisọs ayararede ke ikpọkidem ñnyin.<verse eid="2CO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Ñnyin idu ke ndik ñkpa kpukpru ini ke uwem ñnyin, ke ntak Jisọs, man uwem Jisọs ñko ọwọrọ owut idem ke ikpọkidem ñnyin emi edikpade. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ke ntak edikwọrọ ñnyin, ñkpa ana ñnyin ke iso, edi emi akabade edi nsinsi uwem ọnọ mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ ete, “Ami ñketiñ koro ñkenimde ke akpanikọ.” Ke ukem Spirit mbuọtidem oro ke ñnyin ñko itiñ koro ñnyin imenim ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ñnyin imọfiọk ite Abasi emi akanamde Ọbọñ Jisọs eset ke ñkpa, eyenyuñ anam ñnyin ñko iset ke ñkpa ye Jisọs, ndien ada ñnyin ye mbufo enim ke iso Esie. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Kpukpru ukut emi ñnyin ibọde mi edi ke ntak ufọn mbufo. Ndien nte mfọn Abasi esimde ediwak owo, mmọ eyenam akam ekọm ọdọk esim Abasi ke ubọñ Esie.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ke ntak emi esit iduọhọ ñnyin. Okposuk edi nte ikpọkidem ñnyin akade iso ndisuhọde, kpa ye oro ñnyin ke ibọ nsọñidem ke Spirit ke usen ke usen. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Mi ekpri esisit ukut emi ñnyin ibọde mi idibighike, edi eyeda nsinsi akwa ubọñ emi okponde akan mme ukut ñnyin. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Ke ntre ñnyin idọñke enyin ke se owo okutde ke enyin, edi idọñ enyin ke se owo mikwe ke enyin, koro se owo okutde ke enyin eyebe efep, edi se owo mikwe eyebighi ke nsinsi.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Koro ñnyin imọfiọk ite, edieke atayat emi ñnyin iduñde ke esit ke isọñ emi owurede, ñnyin imenyene ufọk emi Abasi ọbọpde ọnọ ñnyin, emi midaha ubọk owo ibọp, ufọk emi ebighide ke nsinsi ke Enyọñ. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Koro ke akpanikọ ñnyin idu ke mmum, imokop udọñ nte ekpesinede ñnyin ufọk emi otode ke Enyọñ, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />koro ke ema ekesine ñnyin ema, owo idikwe aba ñnyin iferi. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ke akpanikọ ñnyin emi iduñde ke atayat emi idu ke mmum ufik; idighe koro ñnyin iyomde esio ñnyin ikpọkidem enyemi efep, edi ñnyin iyom emen ikpọkidem enyọñ esine ñnyin edori ke enyemi, man otodo uwem emen se idikpade emen. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Edi Abasi ekebeñe ñnyin idem ọnọ ukpuhọde emi, ndien Enye ama ọnọ ñnyin Spirit Esie nte ubiọñ kabaña kpukpru se enye ebeñede enim ọnọ ñnyin.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Mmọdo ñnyin ikokop isọñ esit kpukpru ini. Ñnyin imọfiọk ite adaña ini nte ñnyin idude ke ufọk ke ikpọkidem emi, ñnyin idu anyan ebiet ye ebiet iduñ Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Koro ñnyin idu uwem ito mbuọtidem, ñnyin iduhọ uwem ito se ñnyin ikutde ke enyin. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Ñnyin imọyọhọ ye idorenyin, ndien imakam ima ikan ndikpọñ ufọk ñnyin ke ikpọkidem emi ñkodu kiet ye Ọbọñ ke ufọk Esie. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ke ntre udọñ ñnyin edi ndinem Enye esit ke kpukpru ñkpọ emi ñnyin inamde ekpedi ñnyin idu ke ikpọkidem enyemi, mme ikpọñde ikpọkidem enye emi, ikodu ye Enye ke enyọñ. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Koro kpukpru ñnyin iyeda usen kiet ke iso itie ikpe Kraist, man owo kiet kiet ọbọ utib emi ekemde ye se enye akanamde ke ini emi enye okodude ke ikpọkidem, eti mme idiọk.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Andida Nnọ Kraist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Ñnyin imọfiọk se edibak Abasi edide, ke ntre ñnyin isin ifik ndinam mmọ efen ekut ye ñnyin. Abasi etim ọdiọñọ ñnyin, ndien ami modori enyin nte ke esit mbufo, mbufo emediọñọ mi ñko.<verse eid="2CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Ñnyin iñwanake nditọñọ ntak ntoro idem ñnyin nnọ mbufo; edi ñnyin iñwana ndinọ mbufo eti ntak ndibure mbure kabaña ñnyin, man mbufo ekpekeme ndibọrọ mme mmọ emi eburede mbure ebaña se owo ekutde ke enyin, edi idighe ke se mmọ ekutde ke esit esie. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Edieke ñnyin idamade, edi ke ntak Abasi; onyuñ edieke ñnyin inyenede eti ibuot, edi man ọfọn ye mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ima Kraist akara ñnyin, ke emi ñnyin imọyuhọ ite ke owo kiet akakpa ke ibuot kpukpru owo, emi ọwọrọde ete ke kpukpru owo enyene ebuana ke ñkpa Esie. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Enye akakpa ke ntak ibuot kpukpru owo, man otodo kpukpru mmọ emi edude uwem ke ema ekebọ nsinsi uwem eto Enye ekudu aba uwem enọ idem mmọ, edi edu uwem mmọ enọ Enye ikpọñ ikpọñ emi akakpade onyuñ eset ke ñkpa ke ntak mmọ. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ñnyin idaha aba idaha ubonñkpọ ererimbot ikpe owo ikpe. Okposuk edi ini ama odu emi ñnyin ikadade idaha ubonñkpọ ererimbot ikpe Kraist ikpe, ñnyin inamke aba ntre. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Mmọdo owo ekededi emi ediande enye ye Kraist, eyedi obufa obot; ñkani ñkpọ ema ebe efep, mbufa ñkpọ eda itie.<verse eid="2CO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Edi Abasi anam kpukpru mme ñkpọ emi, Enyemi okotode ke Kraist anam ñnyin itie ke emem ye Enye, okonyuñ ọnọde ñnyin utom, ete ñnyin inam mmọ efen etie ke emem ye Enye ñko. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Koro edi ke Kraist ke Abasi anam ererimbot etie ke emem ye Enye, Enye ibatke mme idiọkñkpọ emi mme owo enamde inọ mmọ. Enye ama onyuñ ayak etop editie ke emem ye Enye esin ñnyin ke ubọk ete ikwọrọ. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Ñnyin idi mme isuñutom emi itiñde ikọ ke ibuot Kraist, nte ñkpọ emi Abasi adade ñnyin ekpe mbufo ubọk. Ñnyin imekpe mbufo ubọk ke ntak Kraist, ite mbufo enam emem ye Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Abasi akanam Enye emi mikọfiọkke idiọkñkpọ akabade edi idiọkñkpọ ke ntak ñnyin; man ñnyin ikabade idi mme ndinen ikọt Abasi ke Enye.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Nte mme mmọ emi ebuanade utom ye Abasi, ñnyin imekpe mbufo ubọk ite, ekuyak mfọn Abasi, emi mbufo ekebọde, ọwọrọ ikpuikpu. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Koro Abasi ọdọhọ ete, “Ami mma ñkop fi ke ini mfọnido Mi, mma ñnyuñ ñnyaña fi ke usen edinyaña.” Kpañ utọñ! Emi edi ini edibọ mfọnido Abasi, mfin edi usen emi anade ebọ ubọhọ.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Ñnyin inimke ñkpọ iduọ ndomo baba kiet ke usuñ mbufo, man mbufo editiñ ikọ ndisuhọde utom ñnyin. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Ke akpanikọ, ñnyin imodomo ndiwut ite ke ñnyin idi mme isuñutom Abasi ye mbon akpanikọ, ke edibọ ukut, ye ọkpọsọñ unana, ye kpukpru mme nsio afanikọñ ke ime.<verse eid="2CO 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Ema emia ñnyin ke ikpa, esin ñnyin ke ufọk ñkpọkọbi, ikut ndutuhọ ke ubọk ñka mbon ntime, inam utom ikpa mba, itaba idap inyuñ isaña biọñ. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Ke edisana ido, ke ifiọk ke anyan ime, ye ke mfọn ido, ñnyin imowut idem ñnyin nte mme isuñutom Abasi oto ke Edisana Spirit ye ata ima ñnyin, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />edikwọrọ ikọ akpanikọ, ye ke odudu Abasi; ye mme ñkpọ ekọñ edinenido ke ubọk nnasia ñnyin ye ke ufien;<verse eid="2CO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Ke ini ukpono ye ke ini esuene, ke etorode ñnyin ye ke eduọhọde ñnyin; ebat ñnyin ke mbio abiaña, edi ñnyin idi mme mmọ emi itiñde akpanikọ.<verse eid="2CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Ebat ñnyin ke didie didie owo, edi ñnyin idi mme ọwọrọ iso owo; ete ñnyin idi mme mmọ emi eyomde ndikpa, edi ñnyin ke isuk idodu uwem; nte mme mmọ emi emiade ufen, edi ñnyin ikpaha. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Ete ñnyin idi mbio mfuhọ, edi ñnyin idu ke idaraesit kpukpru ini; nte mme mmọ emi ebuenede, edi imanam ediwak owo enyene ñkpọ; nte mme mmọ emi minyeneke baba ñkpọ kiet, edi ñnyin imenyene kpukpru ñkpọ:<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Ñnyin imetiñ ikọ añwa añwa inọ mbufo, imonyuñ inyene iñwañ iñwañ esit ye mbufo mbon Kraist. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ñnyin inanake mbọm ke esit ñnyin ibaña mbufo, akam edi mbufo enana mbọm ke esit mbufo ebaña ñnyin. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ami ntiñ emi idahaemi nte mbufo ekpedide mme nditọ mi, ewut ñnyin ukem esit emi ñnyin inyenede ibaña mbufo. Enyene iñwañ iñwañ esit ye ñnyin.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunyime Ntọmbuak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ekudian idem ye mmọ emi minimke ke akpanikọ, koro emi ikemeke nditibe. Unen ye ukwañ ekeme didie ndidi nsaña? Uñwana ye ekim ekeme didie ndiduñ ọtọ kiet? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Nso nduk ke Kraist oduk ye Setan? Mme nso udeme ke andinim ke akpanikọ enyene ye enyemi minimke ke akpanikọ? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Nso ediomi odu ke ufọt Edisana ebiet Abasi ye ndem? Koro ñnyin idi ebiet iduñ Abasi uwem; kpa nte Abasi ke idem Esie ọkọdọhọde ete, “Ñyeduñ, ñyenyuñ nsaña ye mmọ, ndien ñyedi Abasi mmọ, mmọ ñko eyenyuñ edi ikọt Mi.” <verse eid="2CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Oro edi ntak emi Ọbọñ ọdọhọde ete, “Ewọñọ ke otu mmọ, enyuñ ediañade idem mbufo ekpọñ mmọ, Ekutuk mme ndek ndek ñkpọ baba kiet; ndien Ami ñyedara mbufo.” <verse eid="2CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Ami ñyedi Ete nnọ mbufo, ndien mbufo eyedi nditọ iren mi ye nditọ iban mi, edi Jihofa ata ọkpọsọñ ọdọhọ.<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Sia ima ikenyene mme akwa eñwọñọ emi, mme ndima ufan, eyak ñnyin ndien idiañade ikpọñ kpukpru mme ñkpọ emi asabarede ikpọkidem ye Spirit, inyuñ inam idem ñnyin asana ekem ke edidu uwem ke idak uteñe Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Etat esit mbufo enọ ñnyin. Ñnyin ikanamke baba owo kiet idiọkñkpọ, mme nditahade owo baba kiet, mme ndituk baba owo ndomokiet. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ami ntiñke emi man mbiom mbufo ikpe; koro mma mbemiso ntim ntiñ nnọ mbufo, nte ke mbufo emeda akpan itie ke esit ñnyin emi anamde ñnyin idu ọtọ kiet kpukpru ini ke uwem ye ke ñkpa. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Mmenyene akamba isọñesit ke idem mbufo, ndien mbure mi ke idem mbufo okpon eti eti. Mbufo emeriọ mi nsọñidem eti eti, enyuñ enam mi ndara, okposuk edi ñkutde ukut ọkpọsọñ.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekeme Ndikọk Ubiak Ñko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ke ini ñnyin ima ikesim Masidonia, nduọkodudu ndomokiet ikọduhọ inọ ñnyin. Mfina ama odu ke kpukpru ebiet, utọk ye mme mmọ eken ye ndik ke esit ñnyin. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ntem Abasi emi ọdọñde mbon ñkpọnnam esit ama ọdọñ ñnyin esit oto ke edidi Taitọs. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Inyuñ idighe edidi esie ikpọñ ikpọñ, edi enye ama ada idọñesit emi mbufo ekenọde enye, edidọñ ñnyin esit ñko. Enye ama etiñ ọnọ ñnyin nte ọdọñde mbufo ndikut mi, ye nte mbufo efuhọde ebaña mi, enyuñ ebeñede idem ndifre ufre ke ibuot mi; oro anam idara mi ama okpon akan se ekedide.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Koro okposuk edi nte ami ñkanamde mbufo ekop mfuhọ oto ke ñwed emi ami ñkọnọde esọk mbufo, ami ntuaha ñkpọfiọk. Koro mokut nte ñwed oro anam mbufo efuhọ, edi anam mbufo efuhọ ke esisit ini. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ami madara idahaemi eti eti, idighe koro mmanam mbufo ekop mfuhọ, edi koro mfuhọ mbufo anam mbufo ekabade esit etiene Abasi. Koro mbufo efuhọde nte ekemde ye ido Abasi, oruk mfuhọ emi Abasi oyomde ikọt Esie efuhọ. Anam ñnyin ikanamke mbufo ekop ubiak ke ndomo baba ntak kiet, <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />koro mfuhọ emi Abasi enyimede ada edikabade esit edi, emi akade ọkọsuñọ ke ubọhọ, ndien editua ñkpọfiọk iduhọ ke utọ mfuhọ oro. Edi mfuhọ obukidem ada ñkpa edi.<verse eid="2CO 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Ese ndien se Abasi anamde ye mfuhọ mbufo emi: nte anamde mbufo enyene iwuk, anam mbufo ekop udọñ ndiyarade ñwut unana ndudue mbufo! Utọ esuene oro, utọ ndighe oro, utọ esit mbọm oro, utọ nsin ifik oro, utọ mbeñeidem ndimia anamidiọk ufen. Emewut idem mbufo nte mme mmọ emi enanade ndo ke ofuri ñkpọ emi.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Okposuk edi nte ñkewetde ñwed nnọ esọk mbufo, ikedighe ke ntak enyemi akanamde idiọkñkpọ, mme owo emi akanamde enye idiọkñkpọ, edi ami ñkewet man nnam añwaña mbufo ke iso Abasi, nte ñwaidem mbufo okponde ye ñnyin.<verse eid="2CO 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ntak edi oro ñnyin ikokopde idọñesit. Ikedighe idọñesit ikpọñ, edi ima idara ito ke idaraesit Taitọs kabaña usuñ nte kpukpru mbufo ekediande ubọk edọñ enye esit, <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ami mma mbebure mbure nnọ enye mbaña mbufo, ndien mbufo ikinyuñ ikpuhu mi. Ñnyin itiñ akpanikọ kpukpru ini inọ mbufo, ke ukem usuñ emi, mbure emi ikeburede ke iso Taitọs ibaña mbufo ọwọrọ akpanikọ. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ima emi enye amade mbufo etetim ọkọri kadaña emi enye etide nte kpukpru mbufo ekebeñede idem ndisuk ibuot nnọ item esie, ye nte mbufo ekedarade enye ke ndik ye ñnyekidem. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Ami mokop inemesit, koro ami menyene ọyọhọ idorenyin ke idem mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ntatubọk Mbon Masidonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Ke emi ñyom nditiñ nnọ mbufo, nditọ ete, se Abasi ke mfọnido Esie anamde ọnọ mme ufọk Abasi emi odude ke Masidonia.<verse eid="2CO 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Okposuk edi emi mmọ ekekutde ediwak ukut ye ọkpọsọñ ini ntem, mmọ ema ebuak akwa idara mmọ ye ọkpọsọñ unana, emi akanamde mmọ enọ enọ ke ntatubọk okposuk edi emi mmọ ekedide mme ata ubuene. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ami nnam emi añwaña mbufo nte ke mmọ ema enọ awak nte mmọ ekekemede, ndien ema enọ ekan idem ukeme mmọ; mmọ ekenọ ke ima esit mmọ. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Mmọ ema ekpe ye ñnyin, ndinọ mmọ ifet ke edinyene ubọk ke ediñwam ikọt Abasi ke Judia. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Mmọ ema enam ebe nte idorenyin ñnyin ekedide, koro akpa ñkpọ emi mmọ ekenamde ekedi ndiyak idem mmọ nnọ Ọbọñ; ndien ke uduak Ọbọñ mmọ ema eyak idem mmọ enọ ñnyin ñko. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ke ntre ñnyin ima inọ Taitọs uyo, enye emi ọkọtọñọde utom emi, ndika iso ke esit ñnyuñ ññwam mbufo ndinam utom ima emi ñkesim utit. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Kpa nte mbufo edade iso ke kpukpru ñkpọ, ke mbuọtidem, ke editiñ ikọ, ke ifiọk ke ifiopesit edinam ñkpọ, ye ke ima emi mbufo emade ñnyin, ekut ete ke mmimọ imonyuñ ida iso ke mfọn edinọ ima esit. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ami nnọhọ mbufo ewuhọ, edi ami ñyom ndidomo udobi ima emi mbufo enyenede, ke ndida ifiop esit mbon efen ndomo ye eke mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Mbufo emefiọk adaña nte Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs ọkọyọhọde ye ima ye mfọnido; okposuk edi emi enye eke nyenede ñkpọ eti eti, edi ke ntak mbufo Enye ama akabade edi ubuene, man oto ke oro Enye edide ubuene, Enye ekeme ndinam mbufo ekabade edi mme enyene ñkpọ owo.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Emi edi item emi nnọde kabaña se ifọnde ye mbufo ke mbubehe emi: ọfọn mbufo ndikure se mbufo eketọñọde isua oko. Mbufo ekedi mme ebem iso, ikedighe ke edinam ikpọñ, edi ekedi ke edibiere nditọñọ idem edinam. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Anam ke ntre, enam utom emi ema; enyene udọñ ndinam utom emi man kpa nte mbufo ekenyenede udọñ nditim utom emi, ndien eda se mbufo enyenede idahaemi enam utom emi; <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Koro edieke udọñ edinọ odude, Abasi eyebọ enọ fo etiene nte afo enyenede ndinọ, idighe ke se afo munyeneke.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Udọñ esit ñnyin idighe ndikut nte efigherede mme mmọ eñwen mbiomo mmọ ndien ekabade efefik mbufo ye ndodobi mbiomo. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Edi sia mbufo enyenede ediwak ke uto ini emi, odot nte mbufo eñwam mme mmọ emi edude ke unana. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Nte ewetde ke Ñwed Abasi, “Enye emi ọkọkọde ediwak ikenyeneke nte awakde akaha, ndien enyemi ọkọkọde esisit ikenanake ikaha.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Ami mọkọm Abasi nte Enye anamde Taitọs enyene ukem udọñ emi ñnyin inyenede ke ndiñwam mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Taitọs ikokopke uyo ñnyin ikpọñ, edi ke ifiopesit ye udọñ idem esie ndiñwam mbufo, akanam enye edi ebine mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Ñnyin imonyuñ idian enye ye eyen ete kiet emi ofuri ufọk Abasi ekponode nte enye emi ọkwọrọde Eti Mbuk emi. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Ke ebede oro, mme ufọk Abasi ekemek enye ndisaña ye ñnyin nte ñnyin ikade iso ke utom mfọn emi ñnyin inamde ndinọ Ọbọñ ukpono ye ndinyuñ ñwut udọñ emi ñnyin inyenede ndiñwam. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ñnyin inyene nditim ñkpeme, man owo edinyene se etiñde edian ñnyin ke usuñ nte ñnyin idade inam utom enọ mfọn emi. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Uduak ñnyin edi ndinam se inende, idighe ke enyin Abasi ikpọñ, edi se inende ke iso owo ñko.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Ke ndidian do, ñnyin imonyuñ idian eyen ete ñnyin kiet efen ye mmọ, emi ñnyin ikodomode enye ke ediwak ini, inyuñ ikut ite ke enye enyene udọñ eti eti kpukpru ini ke ndiñwam, enye onyuñ etim esin ifik, oto ke akwa mbuọtidem emi enye enyenede ke idem mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Edieke owo kiet ekededi obupde mbufo owo emi Taitọs edide edọhọ enye ete ke enye edi nsañautom mi, emi asañade ye ami anam ñkpọ ọnọ mbufo, ndien mbufo emekeme nditiñ ñko ete ke nditọ ete iba eken edi ke ibuot mme ufọk Abasi; mmọ edi ubọñ Kraist.<verse eid="2CO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Mmọdo ewut mmọ ima emi mbufo enyenede ye ntak emi ñnyin idade mbufo inam inua, man ofuri ufọk Abasi ekeme ndikut.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ufọn ndomokiet iduhọ inọ mi ndiwet mbufo mbaña edinam ñkpọ nnọ ikọt Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Koro ami mọfiọk udọñ emi mbufo enyenede ke ndiñwam, ñnyuñ nda mbufo nnam inua nnọ mbio Masidonia, ñnyuñ ndọhọ mmọ nte ke tọñọ ke isua oko ekebede, mbufo emi edude ke Akaya ema ebeñe idem ndinọ enọ, anam oto ke ntak ifiopesit ye udọñ emi mbufo; enyenede ediwak owo edaha eda etọñọ ndinam ñkpọ. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Edi ami mmọdọñ nditọ ete edi man nnaminua emi ami nnamde mbaña mbufo ediwọrọ ikpuikpu kabaña ñkpọ emi, man mbufo ebeñe idem ke uñwam mbufo, kpa nte ami ñkọdọhọde. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />But eyenam mi eti eti, ndien ntre ke edidi ye mbufo ñko, edieke ndusuk mbon Masidonia emi esañade ye ami edi, edinyuñ ikutde ete ke mbufo ibeñeke idem, kadaña emi ami mma ñketiñ nnọ mmọ mbaña mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nọ, Ndien Abasi Eyesio Usiene Ọnọ Fi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ke ntre ami mma ñkere nte ke ọfọn ami ndidọñ nditọ ete ebem iso edi ebine mbufo, man otodo mbufo enam ndutim emi otukde enọ emi mbufo ekeñwọñọde, okure. Ami ñyom emi edi ata enọ ima esit, okudi nte enọ emi enyikde nyik mbufo ndinọ. <verse eid="2CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Edi eti emi, edieke enọde esisit, eyebọ esisit. Ọtọ iñwañ emi ọtọde esisit ñkpasip enyene ndidọk esisit mfri, edi, edieke enye ọtọde ediwak ñkpasip enye eyedọk ediwak ñko. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Yak owo kiet kiet ọnọ nte enye akaduakde ke esit esie ndinọ, okunọ ye ñkuni mme ke edinyenyik, koro Abasi ama owo emi ọnọde ke inemesit. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Ndien Abasi ekeme ndinọ mbufo ñkan nte mbufo eyomde, man oto do mbufo enyene se mbufo eyomde kpukpru ini enọ idem mbufo, onyuñ ọsuhọ se edade enam kpukpru nti utom. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Nte Ñwed Abasi ewetde ete, “Enye ama atat ubọk ọnọ mme ubuene ñkpọ, mfọnido Esie ebighi ke nsinsi.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Ndien Abasi emi ọnọde ọtọ iñwañ ñkpasip nditọ, ye uyo, nte udia, eyenyuñ anam ñkpasip emi mbufo editọde awak, onyuñ anam mbuñwum edinen ido mbufo etọt.<verse eid="2CO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Eyenam mbufo enyene inyene ke kpukpru usuñ, man otodo mbufo ekeme nditat ubọk nnọ enọ ke kpukpru usuñ, man ediwak owo ekpekọm Abasi oto ke enọ mbufo emi mmọ ebọde eto ñnyin. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Se mbufo enamde emi idighe ndiyọ unana ikọt Abasi ikpọñ, edi anam mmọ enọ Abasi ọyọhọ ekọm ñko. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Oto ke ntak eti edinam emi utom mbufo emi adade edi, mme ediwak owo eyetoro Abasi ebaña nte mbufo esukde ibuot enọ Eti Mbuk Jisọs Kraist, emi mbufo ekwọrọde, ye ke ntatubọk emi mbufo edade Eti Mbuk emi ebuana ye mmọ ye kpukpru mme owo efen. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Ndien ke ntọtuñọ esit ima mmọ eyebọñ akam ebaña mbufo ke ntak utibe mfọn emi Abasi ọnọde mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Ekọm enyene Abasi ke enọ Esie emi inua mikemeke nditiñ.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pọl Owut Unen Esie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Ami Pọl mmekpe mbufo ubọk ke ifure ifure ido nte emi Kraist ke idem esie akpanamde. Ami emi ndide owo nsuhọde idem ke iso mbufo, kini ndude ye mbufo, ñnyuñ nsọñde inua ke ñwed kini ami mmenduhọ ye mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ami mmekpe mbufo ubọk nte ekunam mi nsọñ ido ye mbufo kini ndidide, koro mebiere nditiñ ikọ uko uko ye mme mmọ oro edọhọde ete ke ñnyin inam ñkpọ ke ido obukidem. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Okposuk edi emi ñnyin idude ke ererimbot, ñnyin iñwanake ekọñ ke ido ererimbot. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ñkpọ ekọñ emi ñnyin idade iñwana ekọñ, idighe ñkpọ ekọñ ererimbot, edi, edi ọkpọsọñ ñkpọ ekọñ Abasi emi ñnyin idade ibiat mme ñkpọsọñ ebiet. Ñnyin ibabiat mme nsu nsu eneni. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Ñnyin iwuri kpukpru ñkpọ ubiọñọ ntañidem emi emenerede ndida mfuk ifiọk Abasi; ñnyin isin kpukpru ekikere esit owo ke ufin inyuñ inam enye osuk ibuot ọnọ Kraist. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Ñnyin ima ikut nte mbufo esukde ibuot enọ Kraist ofuri ofuri, ñnyin iyedu ke mbeñeidem ndien ndimia mme mbon nsọñibuot ufen.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Mbufo ese ñkpọ emi enyọñ enyọñ. Edieke owo ọdọhọde ete ke imọ idi eke Kraist, yak enye ekere ikaba ete ke ñnyin ñko idi eke Kraist kpa nte enye edide. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ami ndikopke but, edieke ami ñkpanamde nam inua mbaña odudu emi Abasi ọnọde ñnyin, odudu ndinam mbufo ekọri, idighe ndinam mbufo eduọ. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Ami ñyomke etie nte ami ññwana ndisin mbufo ndik, oto ke ñwed emi ami ñwetde nnọ esọk mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ndusuk owo eyedọhọ ete, “Mme ñwed emi enye ewetde enyene udobi onyuñ enyene odudu, edi ini emi enye odude mi ye ñnyin ke idem esie, enye edi owo mmemidem, ndien mme ikọ esie iwọrọke ñkpọ ndomokiet.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Yak utọ owo emi ọfiọk ete ke ukpuhọde ndomokiet iduhọ ke se ñnyin iwetde ke mme ñwed ñnyin ke ini emi ñnyin miduhọ do ye se ñnyin idinamde ke ini ñnyin ididude do ye mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ñnyin iyomke ndidomo idem ñnyin, mme ndibat idem ñnyin nsin ke otu mme mmọ emi etorode idem mmọ. Kadaña emi mmọ edade idem mmọ edomo ye idem mmọ, enyuñ edade ubonñkpọ idem mmọ etebe idem mmọ ikpe, mmọ inyeneke ọniọñ.<verse eid="2CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ñnyin idinamke inua ibe adaña; edi iyenam inua nte asañade ekekem ye idaha udeme utom emi Abasi ekenimde ọnọ ñnyin, utom emi asañade esim mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ñnyin idikaha anyan ikaha ke unam inua ñnyin nte ekpedide edieke ñnyin misimeke mbufo, koro ñnyin ima isaña añyan usuñ emi idisim mbufo ye Eti Mbuk Kraist. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Ñnyin ibehe adaña ñnyin ke ndinam inua mbaña utom emi mme mmọ efen enamde. Edi imodori enyin ite nte mbuọtidem mbufo akade iso ndikọri, utom ñnyin ke otu mbufo ayatara eti eti.<verse eid="2CO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Man ñnyin ikeme ndikwọrọ Eti Mbuk emi ke mme ikpọ obio efen emi oyomde usuñ ye mbufo, koro ñnyin iyomke ndinam inua mbaña utom emi ema ekenanam ke itie utom owo efen. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Edi, yak owo emi anamde inua anam inua kabaña utom emi Ọbọñ anamde. <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Koro idighe owo emi otorode idem esie ke ebat ke eti, edi owo emi Ọbọñ otorode.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Mmenim nte ke mbufo eyenyene ime ye ami ke ekpri esisit ndisime emi ami nsimede; mbọk enyene ime ye ami! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ami mmefibe ufup kpa nte Abasi efubede abaña mbufo; ami mma ññwọñọ ndida mbufo nnọ ebe kiet, Kraist ke idem Esie, nte eyen añwan emi akananam mikpereke erenowo. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Edi ami mokop ndik nte, nte urukikọt akabiañade If ke iñwañ Eden, ekikere esit mbufo ekeme ndiyo ñkpọñ edinam akpanikọ ye edisana ido ye Kraist. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Edieke owo edide edikwọrọ Jisọs emi ọkpuhọrede ye Jisọs enyemi ñnyin ikọkwọrọde, onyuñ edieke mbufo ebọde Spirit emi ọkpuhọrede ye Spirit emi mbufo ekebọde, edieke enyuñ ekopde ukwọrọ ikọ emi edide isio, ye ukwọrọ ikọ emi mbufo ekekopde ke inua ñnyin, ana mbufo enyene ime.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iren Emi Edi Mbio Abiaña</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ami ñkereke nte ke mme “Ikpọ mme asañautom” nte ekotde mmọ, efọn ekan mi ke ndomo usuñ ndomokiet. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Ekeme ndidi ami mbọhọ ukpep mbaña utiñ ikọ, edi idighe ke ifiọk; ñnyin ima inam emi añwaña mbufo ke kpukpru oruk usuñ.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Mme nte idiọkñkpọ ke ami ñkanam ke ami ndisuhọde idem mi man mbufo ewọrọ ñkpọ, ke ndikwọrọ Eti Mbuk Abasi nnọ mbufo ke mfọn? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Ami mma ntuk mme ufọk Abasi eken, ke ndibọ mmọ enọ man otodo ñkeme ndinam ñkpọ nnọ mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Kpa ke idem ini ñkodude ke unana ke ini ñkodude ye mbufo, ami ñkedighe mbiomo nnọ baba owo kiet; koro nditọ ete emi eketode ke Masidonia edi, ema eda kpukpru se inanade mi esọk mi. Ndien ami momum idem mi ñkama ke kpukpru usuñ, man ami ndidi mbiomo nnọ mbufo. Ñyesuk ñka iso nnam ntre. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Adaña nte akpanikọ Kraist odude ke esit mi baba owo ndomokiet ke ofuri obio Akaya idikemeke ndikpan mi ndinam inua mbaña ñkpọ emi. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ntaha? Mme edi koro ami mmemmaha mbufo? Abasi ọfiọk ete ke ami mmama mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Ami ñyesuk ñka iso nnam se ami nnamde idahaemi, man otodo ami mbiọñọ mme mmọ oro ndinyene ntak nditañ idem, ñnyuñ ndọhọ nte ke utom mmimọ ye eke ñnyin edi ukem.<verse eid="2CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Koro mme mmọ emi edi mme mbet abiaña, mme anamutom nsu, ke ndikabade idem mmọ nnim nte mme Mbet Kraist. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Eyighe inyuñ iduhọ, koro idem Setan ekeme ndikabade idem esie ntie nte enjel uñwana. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Mmọdo idighe akamba ñkpọ edieke mme anamutom esie ekabarede idem mmọ enim nte mme anam utom edinen ido. Ke utit mmọ eyebọ nte ekemde ye se mmọ ekenamde.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ami mmọtọñọ ntak ndọhọ nte yak owo baba kiet okukere ete ke ami ndi ndisime. Edi edieke mbufo edade mi nte ndisime, nte ededi, enyime mi ke ndisime mi, man ami ñko ñnyene esisit nnaminua. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Se ami ntiñde idahaemi, idighe se Ọbọñ ekpetiñde; edi ke nnaminua emi ami nnamde, ami nnam nte ndisime, <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Sia ediwak owo enamde inua ke usuñ emi ererimbot enamde, ami ñyenyuñ nnam ñko. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Mbufo enyene ime ye mbon ndisime ke inemesit, sia mbufo edide mme ọfiọk ñkpọ owo. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ke akpanikọ, mbufo emenyene ime ye owo, ke enye adade mbufo esin ufin, mme adiade inyene mbufo, mme enye adade ñkari omum mbufo, mme atañde idem, mme enye onyuñ eyibide mbufo ke mbañ. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ami mokop but ndidọhọ nte ke ñnyin ikenyene uko ndinam mme ñkpọ oro. Edi edieke owo baba kiet ekemede nditaña ase mbaña ñkpọ ekededi — ami ntiñ nte ndisime — ami mmenyene ukeme ñko nditaña ase.<verse eid="2CO 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Nte mmọ edi nditọ Hibru? Ntre ke ami ndi ñko. Nte mmọ edi nditọ Isrel? Ntre ke ami ndi ñko. Nte mmọ edi nditọ Ebraham? Ntre ñko ke ami ñnyuñ ndi.<verse eid="2CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Nte mmọ edi mme asañautom Kraist? (Ntiñ nte owo idat). Edi ami mmedi eti asañautom ñkan mmọ. Ami mma nnam ọkpọsọñ utom ñkan mmọ, ami mmaka ñkpọkọbi ediwak ini, ami mọbọ ufen kpa emi ananade ibat, ñnyuñ ñkpere ñkpa ediwak ini. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Mma mbọ ubọk ikpa edip ye usukkiet utim ikotion ke ubọk mme Ju, <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />eda esañ ukwak emia mi utim ikata; ema enyuñ etọñọ mi ke itiat ini kiet. Ubom mi ama osip utim ikata, mma ndañ ke ufọt inyañ ibom okoneyo kiet ye uwemeyo kiet. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ke mme ediwak isañ emi ami nsañade, mma ñkut afanikọñ ke akpa mmọñ inyañ ye ke ubọk mbon ñwo; mma ñkut afanikọñ ke ubọk ikọt ñnyin mme Ju, ye ke ubọk mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju; mma ñkut afanikọñ ke mme ikpọ obio, mma ñkut afanikọñ ke mme ñkpri obio, mma ñkut afanikọñ ke inyañ ibom, ndien mma ñnyuñ ñkut afanikọñ ke otu nditọ ete abiaña. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Ami mma nnam ọkpọsọñ utom ye ukut, ndien ediwak ini ami nsidehe idap; ami mọdiọñọ se biọñ ye nsatitọñ edide ndien ediwak ini ami nsitie biọñ; tueb esimum mi ñnyuñ nsaña iferi ke idem.<verse eid="2CO 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Ke esiode kpukpru mme ñkpọ emi efep, ami menyene mfighe kpukpru ini ke esit mi mbaña kpukpru mme ufọk Abasi. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Anie owo odu ke mmemidem, ndien ami ntre nditiene enye ñkop mmemidem oro? Anie owo ke enam enye anam idiọkñkpọ, ndien ami ntre ndiyat esit?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Edieke anade nte nnam inua, ndinam inua kabaña mme ñkpọ oro esioñode mme mmemidem mi ewut; <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Abasi ye Ete Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist, emi itoro ye ekọm enyenede Enye ke nsinsi, ọfiọk ete ami nsuhu nsu. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Nte uwutñkpọ, ke Damaskọs, andikara emi odude ke idak ukara Edidem Aretas, ama obon mbon ekọñ ete ekpeme inua otop obio man emum mi. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Edi ema esin mi ke akpasa eyiri uruk enyuñ esio mi ke odudu ibibene esuk mi, ndien mma mbọhọ ke ubọk esie.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Odudu Abasi Ke Mmemidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ami ñnyene ndika iso nnam inua, okposuk edi oro minyeneke udori, edi ñyetiñ mbaña ñkukut emi ami ñkokutde ye ediyarade emi Ọbọñ akayararede ọnọ mi.<verse eid="2CO 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ami mmọdiọñọ owo kiet ke Kraist emi ekemende enye eda edọk ke ọyọhọ enyọñ ita ke isua duopenañ emi ekebede. Ami ndiọñọke mme ñkpọ emi edi se iketibede ke ikpọkidem, mme enye okokut ñkukut, edi Abasi ikpọñ ọdiọñọ. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Ntọñọ ntak ntiñ nte, ke ami mmọdiọñọ nte ke ema emen owo emi eka ke Paradais (ami mfiak, ndọhọ nte ami ndiọñọke mme ñkpọ emi edi se iketibede ke ikpọkidem mme ekedi ñkukut edi Abasi ikpọñ, ọdiọñọ), <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />do ke enye okokop mme ñkpọ emi owo mikemeke ndida nsin ke usem, mme ñkpọ emi inua owo mikemeke nditiñ. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Ami mmonyuñ nda oruk owo oro nnam inua, edi ndinamke inua mbaña idem mi, ke mibọhọke abaña mme mmemidem mi. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Edieke okpodude mi ke udọñ ndinam inua, ami ñkpedighe ndisime, koro ami ñkpetiñ akpanikọ. Edi ami ndinamke inua, man owo ndomokiet edikere ete ke ami mokpon ñkan se enye okutde ami nnamde ye se ami ntiñde.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Edi man ebiọñọ mi ndikohode idem mi ñkaha, ke ntak utọ akamba ediyarade emi okponde ntem, ema esin mi ñkukim ke obukidem, isuñutom Setan onyuñ edituhọde mi, man ọbiọñọ mi ndikohode idem mi ñkaha. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ami mma ñkpe Ọbọñ ubọk utim ikata mbaña ñkpọ emi, nte Enye emen efep ke idem mi.<verse eid="2CO 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Edi Enye ama ọbọrọ mi ete, “Mfọn Mi edi kpukpru se afo oyomde, koro odudu mi ọsọñ akan kini afo odude ke mmemidem”. Ntre ke ntim ndat esit eti eti ndibure mbure kabaña mmemidem mi, man odudu Kraist odoro mi ke idem. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ami mọyuhọ ke mmemidem mi, ye esuene, ye nsọñọ ñkpọ ye ukọbọ, ye mme mfina, ke ntak Kraist. Koro kadaña emi ami ñkopde mmemidem, ini oro ke ami ñkop odudu.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ami mmada idem mi nnam ndisime, ndien edi mbufo ekenam mi nnam ntre. Akpana mbufo etoro mi, koro ami mmeñkprike ke baba usuñ ndomokiet ñkan mme ata ikpọ mbet mbufo oro, okposuk edi oro ami mmendighe ñkpọ. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Mma nda anyan ime nnam kpukpru utom emi owutde ete ke ami ndi mbet ke akpanikọ, ke mme idiọñọ ye mme utibe ñkpọ, ye mme utom odudu. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ke nso utọ usuñ ke mbufo ekekpri ekan mme ufọk Abasi eken, ke mibọhọke ke emi ami mme ñkedighe mbiomo nnọ mbufo? Mbọk edahado enọ mi ke ndudue emi.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ami Ñyetọñọ Ntak Ndi Ntiene Mbufo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Emi edi ọyọhọ ikata emi ami ñyomde ndidi ndise mbufo ndien ami ndidighe mbiomo nnọ mbufo, koro ami ñyomke inyene mbufo, edi ñyom mbufo idem. Idighe nditọ ekpetim ñkpọ enim enọ mme ete ye eka mmọ, edi mme ete ye mme eka mmọ enyene nditim ñkpọ nnim nnọ nditọ mmọ. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Ami ñyekop inemesit ndibiat kpukpru se ami ñnyenede ye idem mi ñko man otodo ami ññwam mbufo. Nte mbufo ekpema mi esuhọde ekan ke ntak emi ami mmade mbufo ke utọ akwaima oro?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Edi yak etie nte etetie, ami ñkedighe mbiomo nnọ mbufo. Edi owo ekeme ndidọhọ ete ke ami ñkedi owo ñkari, ndien ke ñkada nsu mmum mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Didie ke ami ñkotuk mbufo nto ubọk mme mmọ emi ñkọdọñde ebine mbufo? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ami mma ñkpe ye Taitọs nte yak enye edi ebine mbufo ndien mma ñnyuñ ndian eyen ete ñnyin eken asaña ye enye. Emekeme ndidọhọ ete ke Taitọs ama otuk mbufo? Nte ami ye enye inamke ñkpọ ukem ukem ito ke ukem ekikere ye ke ukem usuñ?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Nte mbufo ekere ofuri emi ete ñnyin iñwana ndinyaña idem ñnyin ke iso mbufo? Ñnyin itiñ ikọ ke iso Abasi, nte mme mmọ emi edude ke Kraist, ndien kpukpru se ñnyin inamde, ndima ufan, edi ndiñwam mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Koro ami mokop ndik nte ke ini ami ndidide, ami ndikwe mbufo nte ami ñkpoyomde mbufo edi, mbufo idinyuñ ikwe mi nte mbufo ekeyomde mi ndi. Ñkop ndik koro ami ndikut ufen, ifiopesit, efam, emiom, ibañaedem, ye ñkohodeidem, ye ndutime. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ke ini nditọñọde ntak ndi, Abasi mi eyenam mi nsuhọde idem ke iso mbufo, ndien ami ñyekop mfuhọ mbaña ediwak owo, emi ekenamde idiọkñkpọ ke ini emi ekebede, ndien mituaha ñkpọfiọk inyuñ ikabade esit ikpọñ mbubiam ido ye use, ye idiọkitọñ emi mmọ ekenamde.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Emi edi ọyọhọ ikata emi ami ndidide ndise mbufo. “Edisọñọ kpukpru edori ikọ ke ikọ ntiense owo iba mme akande oro,” nte Ñwed Abasi etiñde. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ami ñyom ndiduri mme mmọ emi ekenamde idiọkñkpọ ke mme ini emi ekebede, ye mme mmọ eken utọñ ke ini emi ñkedide ndise mbufo ọyọhọ ikaba, ndien ami ñyetọñọ ntak ntiñ idahaemi ami mme nduhọ do: ke ami mma ntọñọ ntak ndi owo baba kiet idibọhọke ufen.<verse eid="2CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Sia mbufo eyomde mi nnam ñwut mbufo nte ke Kraist ebe ke idem mi etiñ ikọ. Enye imemke ke edinam Esie ke otu mbufo, edi Enye edi enyene odudu ke otu mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Koro ke akpanikọ ekekọñ Enye ke etoñkpa ke mmemidem, edi Enye odu uwem oto ke odudu Abasi. Ñnyin ñko ke edidiana kiet ye Enye idi mme mmeme; edi ke odudu Abasi ñnyin iyedu uwem ke Enye inam ñkpọ inọ mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eduñọde Idem Mbufo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Eduñode idem mbufo ese mme mbufo ke ededu ke mbuọtidem, etim edomo idem mbufo. Nte mbufo ifiọkke ite, ke Kraist Jisọs oduñ ke esit mbufo? Ibọhọke mbufo ibehe udomo. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Mmenyene idorenyin nte ke mbufo emekeme ndinyime ete ke ami mma ñkut idomo oro, ndien ke emi ke akpanikọ ami ñke kpuho, ndi eke Ọbọñ.<verse eid="2CO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ndien ñnyin imebeñe Abasi ite mbufo ekudue ke ndomo baba ñkpọ kiet, idighe man mme owo ekut ete ke ñnyin imanam ọfọn, edi man mbufo enam se inende, okposuk edi nte etiede nte ñnyin imokpu. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Koro ñnyin mikemeke ndinam ndomo baba ñkpọ kiet ndibiọñọ akpanikọ, edi ñnyin ida ye akpanikọ ikpọñ. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ñnyin imadat esit kini idem ememde ñnyin, edi mbufo ke ekop nsọñidem. Ndien ñnyin ibọñ akam ite mbufo ekpekam efọn ema.<verse eid="2CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Emi edi ntak emi anamde mi ñwet mme ñkpọ emi kini ami menduhọ ye mbufo; emi edi ntre, man ami ndisọñ ido ye mbufo kini ami ndidide, ke edida unen emi Abasi ọnọde mi nsin ke edinam, unen ndibọbọp mbufo idighe ndisuan mbufo;<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ke akpatre ikọ, etie suñ nditọ ete! Eñwana ndifọn mma, ekop uyo mi, enyene esit kiet, etie ke emem. Ndien Abasi ima ye emem eyedu ye mbufo.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ekọm kiet eken ke edisana usuñ. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Kpukpru Ikọt Abasi enọ ekọm esọk mbufo. <verse eid="2CO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Yak mfọn Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist, ye Ima Abasi, ye ebuana Edisana Spirit odu ye mbufo kpukpru.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>